{
  "_comment": [
    "ScanToBIM Family Mapping — site-specific configuration.",
    "Copy this file to your Revit project folder and replace family/type names",
    "with those loaded in your project template.",
    "",
    "Resolution priority per element:",
    "  1. revit_family_hint on the instruction (operator override)",
    "  2. This config — match family name in project, apply type_rules",
    "  3. Category first-match fallback (any loaded family in that category)",
    "  4. Audit event flags which path was used so reviewers know",
    "",
    "type_rules: evaluated top-to-bottom, first match wins.",
    "  max_diameter_mm  — matches if diameter_mm < this value",
    "  max_height_mm    — matches if height_mm < this value",
    "  max_major_mm     — matches if major_mm < this value",
    "  (no condition)   — catch-all default",
    "",
    "geometry_style (optional):",
    "  'cylindrical' — element is rendered as a closed cylinder shell in Revit",
    "  'box'         — element is rendered as a solid cuboid (default)",
    "  Used by ElementTypeConfigService.cs to drive ScanGeometryBuilder rendering",
    "  without any hardcoded HashSet in C# code."
  ],

